    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7d64e083-7e5a-357f-ae55-d06fb72bd135",
                "word": "undeniable",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                        "entry_id": "7d64e083-7e5a-357f-ae55-d06fb72bd135",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Irrefutable, or impossible to deny."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4cb309c2-3c4e-4d97-8ab6-634b7774a840",
                                "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                                "text": "Some believe that there is undeniable evidence of UFOs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47a91a15-04a2-4588-a407-6249cc4abfcd",
                                "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                                "text": "After all, it is undeniable that the B.R. standard coach scored highly in comparative trials with other European railway vehicles on the Continent a few years ago, so that B.R. civil engineers must share responsibility for any defects in its behaviour over here."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c779823d-f5b1-4424-956c-e1633cce697e",
                                "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                                "text": "If successful, Edison and Ford—in 1914—would move society away from the[…]hazards of gasoline cars: air and water pollution, noise and noxiousness, constant coughing and the undeniable rise in cancers caused by smoke exhaust particulates."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9c37f7b-06f8-4dad-a973-9625b411397d",
                                "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                                "text": "The connection between dictionaries and standardised forms of language is undeniable, yet, at the same time, not well understood."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db7530b7-c7ce-4c27-9e91-d22c553b7581",
                                "sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                                "text": "The dispatches […] also exposed the blatant discrepancy between the west's professed values and actual foreign policies. Having lectured the Arab world about democracy for years, its collusion in suppressing freedom was undeniable as protesters were met by weaponry and tear gas made in the west, employed by a military trained by westerners."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c5cde66b-8fde-4f96-94e5-a4d41a32300e",
                        "source_entry_id": "7d64e083-7e5a-357f-ae55-d06fb72bd135",
                        "source_sense_id": "0ef83a75-c26d-332a-b31e-a03a00386c77",
                        "source_sense_description": "irrefutable, or impossible to deny",
                        "target_lang_word": "nepopiratelný",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nepopiratelný",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f617bb62-6073-39c5-aff4-056c8dcc9f56",
                                        "entry_id": "e744b7a6-a2f6-39c4-856e-358cb2d423b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "takový, kterého, který nelze popírat či popřít"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c5f4cbd-6cde-4421-8f9e-ee4f1d909ab4",
                                                "sense_id": "f617bb62-6073-39c5-aff4-056c8dcc9f56",
                                                "text": "Podle belgického politologa Jeana-Michela De Waeleho z bruselské univerzity ULB je výsledek voleb \"nepopiratelným vítězstvím\" Andreje Babiše, nicméně zároveň nejde \"o politické zemětřesení\". \"Uvidíme, jakou koalici bude Babiš schopen vybudovat, v každém případě to bude komplikované,\" uvedl politolog. S kým bude schopen koalici vytvořit? A za jakou cenu?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
